Steps to run Lind Facil Stack

1. Remove makefile, cp makefile-nacl as makefile
2. Run bootstrap_nacl
3. Compile full lamp stack via src/scripts/lamp/compile_lamp.sh and load via load_lamp.sh
4. Load facil related files via ./load_facil.sh
5. Run lind facil stack via: lind /bin/bash facil_lind_stack.sh
